    "description": "<p>This is an exclusive 1/1 collection bringing together the handmade hats and classic shoes of Coup de Tete and the bold and beautiful fabrics of 18 Waits. This small batch collection of European Hare felt hats has been created with a new padded sweatband that allows a super comfortable fit that fits multiple sizes. These pieces were created and assembled by both brands as a celebration of these two companies and their close ties through the years. From Burning Tradition to “wear well, enjoy, love, destroy” these two brands share a similar ethos and are the perfect match which is reflected in this collaboration.<i></i></p>",
