    "title": "Fabric Sale",
    "collection_url": "https://18waits.com/collections/fabric-sale",
    "description": "<div style=\"padding-left: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"> <strong>We're taking our legendary fabric sale online.</strong></span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Shop our collection of high quality fabrics made in Japan, Portugal, Canada and the US.</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding-left: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">All fabrics are $20/yard.</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding-left: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Many of our cotton fabrics make excellent face masks - we have been donating fabric to local organizations for just that purpose.</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding-left: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">We will be uploading more fabrics as soon as we can, so check back frequently.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Quantity of 1 = 1 yard and will be cut in one piece.</span><br><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">Please note that due to the vast colour variances in every monitor and mobile device, we cannot guarantee the colour will be an exact match to what you see online.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">While every effort is made to accurately quote quantities of available fabric, at times we may be short. If this is the case with your order, we will contact you.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Questions? Email us at info@18waits.com</span>\n</div>",
    "products_count": 179,
