    "collection_url": "https://18waits.com/collections/vintages",
    "description": "<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">18 Waits garments are built to last. Whether they’re brand new or pre-loved, they’re sure to look and feel great - for many years to come. Our styles are timeless and meant to fit into any classic wardrobe. We’ve always loved, and have been inspired by, vintage clothing - and now you can own your very own vintage 18 Waits. Some of these fabrics we haven’t seen in 10-15 years and, like good old friends, it’s really nice to be reacquainted. </div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">As always, 100% Made in Canada. Forever Enjoyed. </div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><i data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*Please don’t hesitate to reach out if you have any specific questions about our Vintages garments (or if you just wanna chat): <a data-mce-fragment=\"1\" href=\"mailto:info@18waits.com\" target=\"_blank\" data-mce-href=\"mailto:info@18waits.com\">info@18waits.com</a></i></div>",
